OL,3,GNEWSABluetongue cases spread across
OL,4,AWest Midlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FGraham Price, who runs a beef and sheep
OL,7,Ffarm near Ludlow, Shropshire, described
OL,8,Fthe influx of cases as "on a par with
OL,9,Ffoot and mouth".
